  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Send a child to school in Honduras for one year</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For orphaned and vulnerable children in Honduras, attending school is often an unattainable dream. Support disadvantaged children in receiving an education, a key component to lifting them out of poverty and into a thriving, sustainable life - both for themselves and for generations to come. Your gift contributes to school tuition for one year at our bilingual, private, Christian school, including book fees, meals, school materials, computer access, extra curricular activities and more.</narrative>
  </description>
